---
import { Building2, Users, HeartHandshake, BookOpen, PhoneCall, ArrowRight } from "lucide-react";
---

<section class="container" style={{ padding: "4rem 1rem 3rem" }}>
  <div class="section-header">
    <span class="section-badge">
      <Building2 size={16} />
      Layanan Prioritas Inklusif
    </span>
    <h2 class="section-title">Akses Mudah Untuk Semua Kebutuhan</h2>
    <p class="section-subtitle">
      Kemenag Barito Utara menghadirkan 5 pilar layanan khusus yang dirancang untuk menjamin hak kesetaraan pelayanan keagamaan bagi seluruh lapisan masyarakat.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div style={{
    display: "grid",
    gridTemplateColumns: "repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr))",
    gap: "1.5rem"
  }}>
    {/* Pilar 1 */}
    <div class="modern-card" style={{ padding: "2rem", display: "flex", flexDirection: "column" }}>
      <div style={{ width: "48px", height: "48px", borderRadius: "12px", backgroundColor: "rgba(11, 96, 86, 0.1)", display: "flex", alignItems: "center", justifyContent: "center", marginBottom: "1.25rem" }}>
        <Users size={24} style={{ color: "var(--primary-color)" }} />
      </div>
      <h3 style={{ fontSize: "1.15rem", fontWeight: 700, color: "#111827", marginBottom: "0.75rem" }}>Haji & Umrah Prioritas</h3>
      <p style={{ fontSize: "0.9rem", color: "#64748b", lineHeight: 1.6, marginBottom: "1.25rem", flex: 1 }}>
        Pendampingan berkas dan fasilitas antrean prioritas bagi jemaah lanjut usia dan penyandang disabilitas di Muara Teweh.
      </p>
      <a href="/booking" style={{ fontSize: "0.875rem", fontWeight: 700, color: "var(--primary-color)", display: "inline-flex", alignItems: "center", gap: "6px" }}>
        <span>Antrean Haji</span>
        <ArrowRight size={16} />
      </a>
    </div>

    {/* Pilar 2 */}
    <div class="modern-card" style={{ padding: "2rem", display: "flex", flexDirection: "column" }}>
      <div style={{ width: "48px", height: "48px", borderRadius: "12px", backgroundColor: "rgba(11, 96, 86, 0.1)", display: "flex", alignItems: "center", justifyContent: "center", marginBottom: "1.25rem" }}>
        <HeartHandshake size={24} style={{ color: "var(--primary-color)" }} />
      </div>
      <h3 style={{ fontSize: "1.15rem", fontWeight: 700, color: "#111827", marginBottom: "0.75rem" }}>Nikah & KUA Aksesibel</h3>
      <p style={{ fontSize: "0.9rem", color: "#64748b", lineHeight: 1.6, marginBottom: "1.25rem", flex: 1 }}>
        Bimbingan perkawinan ramah difabel dengan juru bahasa isyarat serta akses gedung KUA yang telah dilengkapi ramp.
      </p>
      <a href="/standar-layanan" style={{ fontSize: "0.875rem", fontWeight: 700, color: "var(--primary-color)", display: "inline-flex", alignItems: "center", gap: "6px" }}>
        <span>SOP Nikah KUA</span>
        <ArrowRight size={16} />
      </a>
    </div>

    {/* Pilar 3 */}
    <div class="modern-card" style={{ padding: "2rem", display: "flex", flexDirection: "column" }}>
      <div style={{ width: "48px", height: "48px", borderRadius: "12px", backgroundColor: "rgba(11, 96, 86, 0.1)", display: "flex", alignItems: "center", justifyContent: "center", marginBottom: "1.25rem" }}>
        <BookOpen size={24} style={{ color: "var(--primary-color)" }} />
      </div>
      <h3 style={{ fontSize: "1.15rem", fontWeight: 700, color: "#111827", marginBottom: "0.75rem" }}>Pojok Literasi Audio</h3>
      <p style={{ fontSize: "0.9rem", color: "#64748b", lineHeight: 1.6, marginBottom: "1.25rem", flex: 1 }}>
        Akses materi keagamaan berbentuk audio deskripsi, terjemahan BISINDO, dan panduan ibadah bagi jamaah tunanetra.
      </p>
      <a href="/layanan/literasi-audio" style={{ fontSize: "0.875rem", fontWeight: 700, color: "var(--primary-color)", display: "inline-flex", alignItems: "center", gap: "6px" }}>
        <span>Buka Literasi Audio</span>
        <ArrowRight size={16} />
      </a>
    </div>

    {/* Pilar 4 */}
    <div class="modern-card" style={{ padding: "2rem", display: "flex", flexDirection: "column" }}>
      <div style={{ width: "48px", height: "48px", borderRadius: "12px", backgroundColor: "rgba(11, 96, 86, 0.1)", display: "flex", alignItems: "center", justifyContent: "center", marginBottom: "1.25rem" }}>
        <PhoneCall size={24} style={{ color: "var(--primary-color)" }} />
      </div>
      <h3 style={{ fontSize: "1.15rem", fontWeight: 700, color: "#111827", marginBottom: "0.75rem" }}>Jemput Bola & Konseling</h3>
      <p style={{ fontSize: "0.9rem", color: "#64748b", lineHeight: 1.6, marginBottom: "1.25rem", flex: 1 }}>
        Petugas Kemenag melayani verifikasi dokumen langsung ke rumah bagi pemohon dengan disabilitas berat atau lansia tirah baring.
      </p>
      <a href="/formulir" style={{ fontSize: "0.875rem", fontWeight: 700, color: "var(--primary-color)", display: "inline-flex", alignItems: "center", gap: "6px" }}>
        <span>Ajukan Jemput Bola</span>
        <ArrowRight size={16} />
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
